-- Index every foreign-key column that is queried by that column, or whose
-- parent rows are deleted (SQLite scans the child table on each parent
-- delete when the child key has no index). Additive only: CREATE INDEX
-- IF NOT EXISTS, no table rebuilds, no data changes.
-- Audit columns (created_by, updated_by, ...) to users are skipped, as are
-- user/organization FKs that no query filters on; see
-- src/db/__tests__/schema-integrity-standard.test.ts.

